# Architecture

## Layers per module (`src/modules/<feature>/`)

- `domain/` — entities, ports (interfaces), `errors.ts`. No Zod, Supabase, `next/*`.
- `application/` — use cases, Zod schemas, guards. Imports only `domain`.
- `infrastructure/` — Supabase adapters, auth provider, factories. Implements ports.
- `presentation/` — Server Actions (`"use server"`), UI-specific types.

## `src/common/`

Shared non-domain infra: `adapters/db`, `adapters/http`, `adapters/logger`, `errors/`, UI.

## Seams (factories)

`infrastructure/*.factory.ts` returns the default adapter. Application calls factories or use cases that call factories — never import Supabase SDK in use cases.

## Reference module

Copy patterns from `src/modules/users/` (CRUD + dual entry). Read `src/modules/users/README.md`.
